<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For Yara 🌙✨</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html, body {
  margin: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #03051c;
  color: white;
}

body {
  position: relative;
}

/* 🌌 Stars */
.stars {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 10% 20%, white, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 70%, white, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 60% 30%, white, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 80% 60%, white, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 90% 15%, white, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 45% 15%, white, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 20% 90%, white, transparent);
  background-size: 250px 250px;
  animation: starsMove 20s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes starsMove {
  from { transform: translateY(0); }
  to { transform: translateY(-250px); }
}

/* 🌙 Moon */
.moon {
  position: absolute;
  top: 12%;
  right: 12%;
  width: 110px;
  height: 110px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #fffbd6;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 20px #fffbd6,
    0 0 50px rgba(255,255,220,.7),
    0 0 100px rgba(255,255,220,.35);
}

/* ☁️ Clouds */
.cloud {
  position: absolute;
  width: 150px;
  height: 45px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
  border-radius: 50px;
  filter: blur(1px);
  animation: cloudMove 30s linear infinite;
}

.cloud:before,
.cloud:after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.cloud:before {
  width: 70px;
  height: 70px;
  left: 25px;
  top: -35px;
}

.cloud:after {
  width: 55px;
  height: 55px;
  right: 25px;
  top: -25px;
}

.cloud1 {
  top: 25%;
  left: -180px;
}

.cloud2 {
  top: 55%;
  left: -300px;
  animation-delay: 10s;
}

@keyframes cloudMove {
  from { transform: translateX(0); }
  to { transform: translateX(130vw); }
}

/* ☄️ Shooting stars */
.shooting-star {
  position: absolute;
  width: 3px;
  height: 90px;
  background: linear-gradient(transparent, white);
  transform: rotate(45deg);
  animation: shooting 5s linear infinite;
}

.s1 {
  top: 10%;
  left: 10%;
}

.s2 {
  top: 35%;
  left: 70%;
  animation-delay: 2s;
}

@keyframes shooting {
  0% {
    transform: translate(0,0) rotate(45deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  10% {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  30% {
    transform: translate(250px,250px) rotate(45deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  100% {
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

/* 💕 Floating hearts */
.heart {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -50px;
  font-size: 22px;
  animation: floatHeart 8s linear infinite;
  opacity: .8;
}

.h1 {
  left: 15%;
  animation-delay: 1s;
}

.h2 {
  left: 50%;
  animation-delay: 4s;
}

.h3 {
  left: 80%;
  animation-delay: 2s;
}

@keyframes floatHeart {
  0% {
    transform: translateY(0) scale(.7);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  20% {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  100% {
    transform: translateY(-110vh) scale(1.3);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

/* ✨ Main content */
.content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 10;
  height: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(40px, 10vw, 75px);
  margin: 0;
  text-shadow:
    0 0 10px #fff,
    0 0 25px #ff8de1,
    0 0 50px #ff4dcc;
  animation: glow 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes glow {
  from {
    transform: scale(1);
  }

  to {
    transform: scale(1.04);
  }
}

.subtitle {
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-top: 15px;
  opacity: .9;
}

button {
  margin-top: 30px;
  padding: 15px 30px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: white;
  color: #4b176e;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,.7);
  transition: .3s;
}

button:hover {
  transform: scale(1.08);
}

#message {
  display: none;
  max-width: 500px;
  margin-top: 25px;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  animation: appear 1s ease;
}

@keyframes appear {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }

  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="stars"></div>

<div class="moon"></div>

<div class="cloud cloud1"></div>
<div class="cloud cloud2"></div>

<div class="shooting-star s1"></div>
<div class="shooting-star s2"></div>

<div class="heart h1">♡</div>
<div class="heart h2">♥</div>
<div class="heart h3">♡</div>

<div class="content">

  <h1>Happy Birthday Yara ✨</h1>

  <div class="subtitle">
    A little piece of the universe made just for you 🌙💫
  </div>

  <button onclick="showMessage()">
    🎁 Open Your Surprise
  </button>

  <div id="message">
    Yara 💕<br><br>

    I hope your birthday is as beautiful and special as you are.
    May this new year of your life be filled with happiness,
    unforgettable moments, and lots of reasons to smile. ✨

    <br><br>

    Keep shining like the brightest star in the sky. 🌌

    <br><br>

    — From someone who cares about you ❤️
  </div>

</div>

<script>
function showMessage() {
  document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
